{"id": "southeast-plant-power-upgrade-vault-delay", "title": "A utility vault pushed the Southeast Plant power upgrade forecast back 315 days", "seconds": 48.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "b98840e27a57311f", "words": 145, "beats": [{"scene": "baseline", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In June 2025, San Francisco reported that a transformer had failed a field test.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.63, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "delayed", "the", "plant’s", "power", "upgrade?"], "sub": "Southeast plant electrical work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.38, 0.63, 1.46, 1.68, 2.12, 2.55, 2.71, 2.78, 3.37, 3.49, 3.72, 3.78, 4.02]}, {"scene": "baseline", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Replacement parts were on order. The completion target remained March 31, 2026.", "t0": 4.75, "t1": 9.69, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "june25", "kicker": "San Francisco Public Utilities Commission", "text": "June 2025 report", "mark": "June 2025 report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.74, 0.89, 1.01, 1.7, 1.85, 2.31, 2.65, 2.98, 3.22, 3.92, 4.22]}, {"scene": "baseline", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The approved project budget was $95.88 million.", "t0": 9.81, "t1": 13.16, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$95.88 million", "label": "Approved project budget in June 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.43, 0.82, 1.18, 1.37, 1.84, 2.09, 2.31, 2.51, 2.82]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "By September, a new forecast put completion on February 9, 2027.", "t0": 13.38, "t1": 17.37, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Two quarterly reports", "heading": "Change in the forecast", "source": "sept25", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Approved target", "value": "March 31, 2026"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Later forecast", "value": "February 9, 2027"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.69, 0.77, 0.94, 1.54, 1.73, 2.22, 2.34, 2.74, 3.11, 3.4]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That was 315 days later than the approved target.", "t0": 17.49, "t1": 20.2, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "315 days", "label": "Forecast later than the approved target"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.31, 0.56, 0.8, 1.2, 1.44, 1.73, 1.89, 2.0, 2.32]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The December report attributed the change to design and investigation for an electrical vault required by the utility.", "t0": 20.32, "t1": 26.28, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "dec25", "kicker": "San Francisco Public Utilities Commission", "text": "Additional design and site investigation", "mark": "Additional design and site investigation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.52, 1.01, 1.56, 1.66, 2.01, 2.13, 2.54, 2.67, 3.79, 3.95, 4.03, 4.46, 4.75, 5.16, 5.27, 5.41]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In March 2026, the city reported that the vault had been inspected.", "t0": 26.4, "t1": 29.87, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "mar26", "kicker": "San Francisco Public Utilities Commission", "text": "March 2026 inspection", "mark": "March 2026 inspection"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.47, 0.71, 1.3, 1.43, 1.68, 2.05, 2.18, 2.29, 2.63, 2.76, 2.92]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In June, the city reported utility acceptance of the vault, underground raceway and restoration.", "t0": 29.99, "t1": 35.2, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "june26", "kicker": "San Francisco Public Utilities Commission", "text": "June 2026 utility acceptance", "mark": "June 2026 utility acceptance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.69, 0.84, 1.11, 1.56, 2.01, 2.5, 2.59, 2.7, 3.42, 3.93, 4.37, 4.5]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The finish date stayed in February 2027. The forecast cost still matched the approved budget.", "t0": 35.32, "t1": 40.93, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "June 2026 forecast"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.58, 0.93, 1.03, 1.53, 1.83, 2.84, 3.01, 3.56, 4.06, 4.38, 4.66, 4.76, 5.13]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The records do not establish a transformer retest, warranty recovery or financial loss.", "t0": 41.05, "t1": 45.67, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Transformer retest", "Warranty recovery"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.46, 0.59, 0.74, 1.2, 1.25, 1.83, 2.69, 3.13, 3.58, 3.69, 4.17]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 45.79, "t1": 47.93, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"baseline": "The original completion target", "change": "The electrical vault"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "question"}